exact same frequency as wands of death.  It's just that wandering monsters
seem to have a tendency to pick up the latter and snuff you out before
you can find the former...  There is also some non-random generation of
both types of wands, biased heavily towards the nastier one, so the actual
frequency of these two types isn't really the same.



